# The tools of the vulnerability gate (.github/workflows/audit.yml), pinned with hashes in
# requirements.txt next to this file: a checking tool that comes in whatever version the index has
# today is itself an unchecked part of the supply chain.
# Deliberately NOT `requirements.in`: with that name Dependabot would treat requirements.txt as a
# pip-compile output and regenerate it instead of raising the lines with their hashes.
pip-audit
uv
